@startuml l2-containers-v1
title C4 Container - V1 Portable Python core (ArchiMate semantics)
left to right direction
archimate #Application "Web UI" as UI <<application-component>>
archimate #Application "Data-Management Service\n(embeds rdf-persistence)" as DMS <<application-component>>
archimate #Application "Identity Provider" as IDP <<application-component>>
archimate #Application "Authorization Engine" as PDP <<application-component>>
archimate #Application "Triple Store" as TS <<application-component>>
archimate #Application "Event Relay" as REL <<application-component>>
archimate #Application "Event Channel" as CH <<application-component>>
archimate #Application "Migration Runner\n(job, embeds rdf-persistence)" as MIG <<application-component>>
archimate #Application "Data-Management API" as API <<application-service>>
archimate #Application "Change Notification" as NOTIF <<application-service>>
DMS .|> API : realizes
REL .|> NOTIF : realizes
API --> UI : serves
NOTIF --> UI : serves
UI --> IDP : sync
DMS --> IDP : sync
DMS --> PDP : sync
DMS --> TS : sync
REL --> TS : sync
REL ..> CH : async
CH ..> UI : async
MIG --> TS : sync
MIG --> IDP : sync
@enduml
